<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 23.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  Cattle	 Calves    Hogs</p>
<p>Wednesday  07/23/97  (est)	132,000	5,000     337,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			132,000	6,000     337,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			127,000	7,000     324,000</p>
<p>Week to date (est)		  388,000     16,000     954,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Week (est)     390,000     17,000     966,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Year (est)     389,000     22,000     957,000</p>
<p>Previous Day Estimated	Steer and Heifer	Cow and Bull</p>
<p>Tuesday				 108,000		     24,000</p>
<p>*USDA revised Tuesday (7/22/97) hog slaugher to 337,000 head</p>
<p>from 343,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
